<main class="zd-goal-grower">

  <section class="zdg-hero zdg-hero--product">

  <div class="zdg-hero__visual">
    <div class="zdg-phone">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Goal Grower app preview"
        width="700"
        height="900"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="zdg-plant-card">
      <span>Shared Garden</span>
      <strong>3 goals growing together</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="zdg-hero__copy">
    <p class="zdg-eyebrow">Goal Grower</p>
    <h1>A garden for your goals.</h1>
    <p>
      Goal Grower turns habits and big goals into plants. Water your goals,
      keep them alive, and grow alongside people in shared gardens.
    </p>

    <div class="zdg-status-chips">
      <span>In Production</span>
      <span>Shared Gardens Available</span>
      <span>Beta Testers Needed</span>
    </div>

    <div class="zdg-actions">
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      <a href="/pages/community">Become a Beta Tester</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

  <section class="zdg-problem">
    <p class="zdg-eyebrow">The Problem</p>
    <h2>Most goal trackers feel like chores.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower turns progress into something visual, emotional, and fun.
      Instead of checking boxes forever, users grow a living garden that reflects
      the goals they are building in real life.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="zdg-feature-grid">

    <article class="zdg-feature zdg-feature--large">
      <span>01</span>
      <h3>Every goal becomes a plant.</h3>
      <p>
        Create goals or habits and watch each one become part of your personal garden.
        Your progress is represented through growth, watering, and plant health.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdg-feature">
      <span>02</span>
      <h3>Water your goals.</h3>
      <p>
        When you make progress, you water the plant. If you stop showing up,
        the plant starts to fade and needs attention.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdg-feature zdg-feature--dark">
      <span>03</span>
      <h3>Shared gardens.</h3>
      <p>
        Create a shared garden with other people who are also working toward goals,
        habits, or commitments together.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="zdg-feature">
      <span>04</span>
      <h3>Built for accountability.</h3>
      <p>
        Shared gardens make goal tracking social without turning it into pressure,
        competition, or another noisy feed.
      </p>
    </article>

  </section>

  <section class="zdg-status">
    <div>
      <p class="zdg-eyebrow">Current Status</p>
      <h2>Goal Grower is still growing.</h2>
      <p>
        The app is in production and needs testing before App Store launch.
        Shared gardens can already be used, and Ziyu Development is looking for
        beta testers to help improve the experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zdg-status__cards">
      <article>
        <span>Available Now</span>
        <h3>Shared Gardens</h3>
        <p>Start testing shared accountability gardens with other users.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>In Progress</span>
        <h3>App Store Testing</h3>
        <p>Preparing the app for testing, feedback, polish, and launch readiness.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Needed</span>
        <h3>Beta Testers</h3>
        <p>Help find bugs, improve the design, and shape the public version.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdg-flow">
    <div class="zdg-section-head">
      <p class="zdg-eyebrow">How It Works</p>
      <h2>A simple growth loop.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zdg-flow-list">
      <article>
        <span>Step 01</span>
        <h3>Create a goal.</h3>
        <p>Choose a habit, big goal, or commitment you want to grow over time.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 02</span>
        <h3>Plant it.</h3>
        <p>Your goal becomes a plant in your personal garden.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 03</span>
        <h3>Water it.</h3>
        <p>Log progress to keep the plant healthy and growing.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 04</span>
        <h3>Grow together.</h3>
        <p>Create shared gardens with people working on goals with you.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zdg-community">
    <div>
      <p class="zdg-eyebrow">Community</p>
      <h2>Help shape the garden before launch.</h2>
      <p>
        Beta testers help make Goal Grower better by testing real usage, shared
        gardens, plant health, onboarding, reminders, and the overall goal flow.
      </p>

      <div class="zdg-actions">
        <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
        <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

